{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43134","headline":"郡城放猨献卫使君 · 易思","name":"郡城放猨献卫使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"千岩万壑与云连，放出雕笼任自然。\n叶洒惊风啼暮雨，月凝残雪饮流泉。\n临岐莫似三声日，避射须依绕树年。\n应解感恩寻太守，攀萝时复到楼前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易思","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43134.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43134","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}